  "question": "On gate-admitted lemons worlds, does a live tenant inspect before it contests and refuse an uninspected unit whose pooled expectation is below the rent? Measured as the tenants' net payoff against the scripted bracket on the same worlds, descriptively and per stratum; one route, no winner, no ranking.",
